_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、所舉古事或未定指代；不補來源未見姓名、成員及關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0108","start":108,"end":111,"surface":"二千石","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、所舉古事或未定指代；不補來源未見姓名、成員及關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0113","start":113,"end":118,"surface":"梁相軒丘豹","kind":"person","person_id":"jrv_ob5_feu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0121","start":121,"end":124,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person","person_id":"doj_zhx_nm1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0126","start":126,"end":127,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0131","start":131,"end":132,"surface":"勝","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_9ev_cht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0133","start":133,"end":134,"surface":"詭","kind":"person","person_id":"2bl_b4d_kfg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0141","start":141,"end":142,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"梁王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"梁王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0156","start":156,"end":159,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person","person_id":"doj_zhx_nm1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0160","start":160,"end":163,"surface":"長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"kvm_6zv_6ez","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m009-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"tjk_5e2_wse","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-058-liang","book_id":"b-shiji-058","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-058-liang"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p026","text":"蓋聞梁王西入朝，謁竇太后，燕見，與景帝俱侍坐於太后前，語言私說。太后謂帝曰：「吾聞殷道親親，周道尊尊，其義一也。安車大駕，用梁孝王為寄。」景帝跪席舉身曰：「諾。」罷酒出，帝召袁盎諸大臣通經術者曰：「太后言如是，何謂也？」皆對曰：「太后意欲立梁王為帝太子。」帝問其狀，袁盎等曰：「殷道親親者，立弟。周道尊尊者，立子。殷道質，質者法天，親其所親，故立弟。周道文，文者法地，尊者敬也，敬其本始，故立長子。周道，太子死，立適孫。殷道。太子死，立其弟。」帝曰：「於公何如？」皆對曰：「方今漢家法周，周道不得立弟，當立子。故春秋所以非宋宣公。宋宣公死，不立子而與弟。弟受國死，復反之與兄之子。弟之子爭之，以為我當代父後，即刺殺兄子。以故國亂，禍不絕。故春秋曰『君子大居正，宋之禍宣公為之』。臣請見太后白之。」袁盎等入見太后：「太后言欲立梁王，梁王即終，欲誰立？」太后曰：「吾復立帝子。」袁盎等以宋宣公不立正，生禍，禍亂後五世不絕，小不忍害大義狀報太后。太后乃解說，即使梁王歸就國。而梁王聞其義出於袁盎諸大臣所，怨望，使人來殺袁盎。袁盎顧之曰：「我所謂袁將軍者也，公得毋誤乎？」刺者曰：「是矣！」刺之，置其劍，劍著身。視其劍，新治。問長安中削厲工，工曰：「梁郎某子來治此劍。」以此知而發覺之，發使者捕逐之。獨梁王所欲殺大臣十餘人，文吏窮本之，謀反端頗見。太后不食，日夜泣不止。景帝甚憂之，問公卿大臣，大臣以為遣經術吏往治之，乃可解。於是遣田叔、呂季主往治之。此二人皆通經術，知大禮。來還，至霸昌廄，取火悉燒梁之反辭，但空手來對景帝。景帝曰：「何如？」對曰：「言梁王不知也。造為之者，獨其幸臣羊勝、公孫詭之屬為之耳。謹以伏誅死，梁王無恙也。」景帝喜說，曰：「急趨謁太后。」太后聞之，立起坐湌，氣平復。故曰，不通經術知古今之大禮，不可以為三公及左右近臣。少見之人，如從管中闚天也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m026-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"梁王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m026-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"竇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"tjk_5e2_wse","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m026-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m026-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"tjk_5e2_wse","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m026-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"tjk_5e2_wse","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shij